ONEDRAFT
CAD-AI — Aria Powered
Application Runtime, Service Architecture & Execution Stack
Version 1.0
Status: Implementation Specification
Predecessor: Database Schema & OpenAPI Contract v0.1
Database: PostgreSQL
API: REST / JSON
API Version: /api/v1
Identifiers: UUID
Primary Model: Versioned OneDraft Project Model
AI Layer: Aria Powered
Execution Model: API + Domain Services + Workers + Event-Driven Jobs
Runtime Principle: Deterministic application services surrounding non-deterministic AI capabilities

1. APPLICATION STACK PRINCIPLE
OneDraft shall now be implemented as an executable distributed application rather than as a collection of independent utilities.
The application stack shall preserve the separation between:
API transport
application orchestration
domain logic
project model
persistence
geometry computation
AI orchestration
regulatory verification
documentation generation
background execution
audit and provenance
The architectural flow becomes:
CLIENT
  ↓
API GATEWAY
  ↓
APPLICATION SERVICES
  ↓
DOMAIN SERVICES
  ↓
PROJECT MODEL
  ↓
POSTGRESQL
with computational workers operating alongside the transactional system:
APPLICATION SERVICES
        ↓
      JOBS
        ↓
 ┌──────┼────────┬──────────┐
 ↓      ↓        ↓          ↓
ARIA  GEOMETRY  CODE      DOCUMENT
WORKER  WORKER  WORKER     WORKER
        ↓
 VALIDATION
        ↓
 PROJECT MODEL

